This patch excludes mode fourteen from the late scheduler-selection trigger.
Its explicit userspace futex-wake entry trigger remains unchanged, so mode
fourteen no longer combines early wake replay with incoming-task selection.
Historical mode-fourteen results used both sites and retain that scope.

--- a/kernel/sched/core.c
+++ b/kernel/sched/core.c
@@ -6719,7 +6719,8 @@
 		    && bp_preview_mode != 10
 		    && bp_preview_mode != 11
 		    && bp_preview_mode != 12
-		    && bp_preview_mode != 13) {
+		    && bp_preview_mode != 13
+		    && bp_preview_mode != 14) {
 			asm volatile("csrw 0x5c0, zero" ::: "memory");
 		}
 		/* Modes three and four skip physical data-hint CSR writes. Count
